    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Wurrband",
    "summary": "Give each friendly ORKS PSYKER model’s [PSYCHIC] attacks +1 S. Add a further +1 S for each group of 5 models in the bearer’s unit or embarked in the bearer. The model has two psychic abilities. Visions of Violence is available as the Fight phase opens. Roar of Mork is available in your Movement phase. To use either, the bearer’s unit must be free of battle-shocked status. Spend 1 psychic level and make the psychic roll on a D6. A result of 1 leaves the bearer’s unit battle-shocked. With Roar of Mork, pick one enemy unit at most 12\" from the bearer’s unit. Exclude MONSTER and VEHICLE units. The foe takes a battle-shock roll, penalised by 1 for each group of 10 models in the bearer’s unit. With Visions of Violence, the bearer’s unit gains Fights First.",
